    "ink-splash: main repository 전투테스트/사방잉크/export.py (numpy+PIL, fixed seed); red = 처치 폭발(ink3_red_05) kill burst drawn at damage radius 6 (fieldRadius 192 px), purple = same shape for 독폭탄 drawn at radius 3.2 (102.4 px); both play at 1x"
  ],
